22. Statistical Relationships

| Method         | Use                     | Example                      |
| -------------- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| `corr()`       | Correlation             | `df.corr(numeric_only=True)` |
| `cov()`        | Covariance              | `df.cov(numeric_only=True)`  |
| `rank()`       | Rank values             | `df["Salary"].rank()`        |
| `pct_change()` | Percentage change       | `df["Sales"].pct_change()`   |
| `diff()`       | Difference between rows | `df["Sales"].diff()`         |


These are particularly useful for Data Science and time-series analysis.
